{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06782","headline":"山行入泾州 · 王昌龄","name":"山行入泾州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倦此山路长，停骖问宾御。\n林峦信回惑，白日落何处。\n徙倚望长风，滔滔引归虑。\n微雨随云收，蒙蒙傍山去。\n西临有边邑，北走尽亭戍。\n泾水横白烟，州城隐寒树。\n所嗟异风俗，已自少情趣。\n岂伊怀土多，触目忻所遇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}